  Adele (#83) commanded a host of loyal soldiers.  Tarsus marched with his 
loyal troops, jaws set in grim resolution.  Tlazolteotl (#88) stood 
determinedly at the head of her thousands.
  Tlazolteotl stepped forward and challenged Tarsus to honorable combat.  
Tarsus accepted the challenge to personal combat.  Tlazolteotl chanted her 
strange words of magic and cast a Gate Demon spell and a flaming gate 
opened, and out of it stepped a horrible demon!  Tarsus thought to attempt a 
Hand Of Death spell, but dropped a crucial material component before Tarsus 
could make his spellcast.  Waving her hands, the Succubus juxtaposed 
otherworldly forces of magic, casting a Psychic Blast spell, projecting 
psychic waves of stunning force towards Tarsus.  His spell was disrupted by 
the event.  Tarsus stood stunned, unable to regain his senses.
  The Succubus advanced to bow range.  Stunned, Tarsus could only shake his 
head in bewilderment.
  The Succubus closed to melee range, seething with blood-lust.  Tarsus was 
stunned and staggered around at random.  The Succubus swang at her fearsome 
nemesis but her aim was slightly off the mark.  The effects of the stun 
finally wore off and Tarsus prepared to attack.  The Succubus treacherously 
thrust at Tarsus but her sword whiffed through the air.
  Tarsus maneuvered for a better defensive vantage.  Then Tarsus swang at 
the Succubus but the Succubus dodged the blow.  Showing no fear, 
the Succubus thrust at Tarsus and scored 1 damage points on him.  Tarsus 
thrust at the Succubus and missed.  The Succubus swang at Tarsus and would 
have hit him if Tarsus hadn't sidestepped just then.
  Tarsus then swang at the Succubus with terrific strength but his aim was 
slightly off.  The Succubus swang at Tarsus and walloped him with 2 damage 
points.  Tarsus swang at the Succubus and scored on the Succubus, doing 3 
points of damage.  The Succubus deftly thrust at Tarsus but her sword 
whiffed through the air.  Tarsus circled right and violently attacked 
the Succubus and inflicted 3 damage points.  The Succubus swang at her 
nemesis and damaged Tarsus, scoring 3 damage points.
  Tarsus feigned retreat, then pivoted and arrogantly swang at the Succubus 
but the Succubus evaded the sword.  The Succubus swang at Tarsus and missed. 
Showing no fear, Tarsus moved in and swang at the Succubus and would have 
struck the Succubus if the Succubus hadn't ducked.  The Succubus thrust at 
Tarsus but her aim was slightly off.
  Tarsus immediately thrust at the Succubus and inflicted 2 damage points on 
the Succubus.  The Succubus then thrust at Tarsus with maximum force but her 
sword whiffed through the air.  Tarsus thrust at the Succubus and walloped 
the Succubus with 6 damage points.  The Succubus acrobatically flipped over 
Tarsus and thrust at him and scored on him, inflicting 4 points of damage.
  Seeking to exploit a gap in the Succubus's defenses, Tarsus skillfully 
thrust at the Succubus but the Succubus evaded the sword.  The Succubus 
assailed Tarsus and missed badly.  Tarsus thrust at his fearsome enemy and 
inflicted 4 damage points.  The Succubus treacherously thrust at Tarsus and 
would have hit him if Tarsus hadn't ducked just then.
  Tarsus thrust at the Succubus but his aim was slightly off the mark.  
The Succubus moved closer and thrust at Tarsus but her sword whiffed through 
the air.  Tarsus feinted in one direction, then crossed over and 
treacherously thrust at the Succubus but the Succubus dodged the sword.  
The Succubus immediately swang at Tarsus and missed badly.
  Tarsus then thrust at the Succubus and damaged the Succubus, inflicting 2 
damage points.  The Succubus daringly thrust at Tarsus and would have hit 
him if Tarsus hadn't sidestepped.  Tarsus contemptuously thrust at 
the Succubus but his aim was slightly off the mark.  The Succubus swang at 
Tarsus but her sword whiffed harmlessly through the air.
  Tarsus attacked the Succubus but the Succubus evaded the sword.  
The Succubus summoned all her strength and bravely swang at her fearsome 
enemy and scored 4 damage points on Tarsus.  Tarsus fell, fatally injured.  
The Succubus disappeared to whence the Succubus came.  And so it came to 
pass that Tarsus met his tragic end.
  The forces commanded by Tarsus were disheartened by his death, yet still 
they moved forward with some hope of victory.  (As a result of the 
