her men somewhat unprepared.  Tlazolteotl (#88)'s men thus obtained a 
considerable edge.  Also, it soon became clear that Adele (#83) was 
tactically outmatched by Tlazolteotl (#88).  Tlazolteotl maneuvered her 
forces with great sagacity.
  Tarsus was frustrated by the Dragons, who could not comprehend his 
commands.
  Out on the left outside wing, the Elite 25th Legion were arrayed against 
